OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping costs council more
OL,4,Athan #1m in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FClearing up fly-tipping has cost a
OL,7,Flocal authority in West Sussex more
OL,8,Fthan #1m in the space of a year,
OL,9,Fcouncillors have been told.
OL,11,FCrawley Borough Council laid out about
OL,12,F#1.3m last year which cabinet member
OL,13,Ffor public protection, Julian Charatan,
OL,14,Fsaid could "otherwise have been
OL,15,Finvested in local services, public
OL,16,Fspaces and community facilities".
OL,18,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service, Charatan also told
OL,20,Fthe full council meeting that 108
OL,21,Fincidents had been investigated in the
OL,22,Flast six months.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
