OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping costs council more
OL,4,Athan #1m in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Fly-tipping is not a victimless
OL,7,Fcrime... it's simply not fair that the
OL,8,Factions of a small minority create
OL,9,Fcosts and problems for everyone else,"
OL,10,Fhe said.
